From 5eb55f37c5393ce4d947cd22916869272f67a2c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:25:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-0150: Wi-Fi for iOS: en0, the station, Apple80211
 (from HackiOS)

HackiOS's (github.com/oosexgang, APSL 2.0) iOS-facing Wi-Fi, ported and
renamed: en0 made with the interface KPI (sapphire_net.c), the station
thread between iOS and a radio (sapphire_sta.c), Apple80211's requests
answered in the kernel for wifid and Settings (sapphire_apple80211.c),
and the registry entries configd and wifid look for (SapphireWLAN.cpp).

sapphire_wlan.c feeds them from upstream's WCN3988 station in
TopazModem.cpp (rx hook, transmit, link hook, scan, heard, join, leave).
With wifi=1, en0 and its entries exist from bsd_init on, link down; the
station is handed over when the radio is up.
